d2ab144-48be-4775-b703-4c1eaa374ab4","created":"2026-09-22T06:46:39.689Z","message":{"text":"📣📣 REVERSE SPLIT ALERT\n\nPlease note, there has been a reverse stock split on Visionwave Holdings Inc - $VWAV\nThe ratio for the split is 1 for 20\n\n\n👉 What is a reverse stock split?\n\nA reverse split is a market event where a company decides to consolidate its existing shares into fewer, proportionally more valuable, shares. The process involves a company reducing the total number of its outstanding shares in the open market according to a certain ratio. For example: if the split ratio is 1:2, then for every two shares previously held, shareholders would now hold a single share. Subsequently, the price of the share is also adjusted according to the same ratio in order to maintain the same overall value.\n\n👉 How do we respond to a stock split?\n\nOur policy in response to a split is to adjust the opening rate of the positions in question to reflect the new rates. This also ensures that all subsequent profit calculations are proportionately correct.\n\nPlease be aware that any price changes for the above-mentioned stocks, as well as changes in holdings of units, are due to this adjustment. 🔊\n\nTo sum it up, the price of the assets and the number of units on the positions may change, but the value of all relevant positions remains the same.\n\n\nThank you,\n\nThe eToroTeam","languageCode":"en-gb"},"updated":"2026-09-22T06:46:39.689Z","isDeleted":false,"type":"Default","metadata":{},"attachments":[{"url":"https://openbook-static-files-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/rich-media/images/etoroteam/bf3dbd42-5eb0-4e30-b37f-5447b9b9cdbb-2026-09-22.png","host":"openbook-static-files-prod.s3.amazonaws.com","mediaType":"Image","media":{"image":{"width":1200,"height":628,"url":"https://openbook-static-files-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/rich-media/images/etoroteam/bf3dbd42-5eb0-4e30-b37f-5447b9b9cdbb-2026-09-22.png"},"video":{"videoSource":"None","image":{"width":0,"height":0}}}}],"isSpam":false,"edi